{%- comment -%}
The IG's Artifacts Summary page, the Publisher's `artifacts.html` rendered by Jekyll from `site.data.fhir`.
Reads `site.data.fhir.artifacts_listed` (how many artefacts the page lists),
`site.data.fhir.artifact_categories[]` (`name`, `keys`, in the Publisher's order)
and, per key, `site.data.fhir.artifacts[key]` (`text.label`, `url.page`, `reference`).
Every value, the count and the label escaping included, is computed by
`artifactVariables` in `build-ig-site.ts`; this file only arranges them.
{%- endcomment -%}
